hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"515","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne barish mangi aur apni chadar palat di."
"516","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni dua mein se kisi mein hath na uthate, siwaye istisqa ke. Aur beshak Aap uthate yahan tak ke Aap ki baghalon ki safedi dekhi jati."
"517","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein logon ko qehet laga. Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Juma ke din khutba de rahe they to ek dehati khada hua aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Maal halak ho gaya aur ghar wale bhooke reh gaye. To Allah se hamare liye dua farmayiye. Phir Aap ne apne dono hath uthaye, jabke hum aasman mein badal ka tukda na dekhte they. Phir Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Aap ne unhe neeche na kiya yahan tak ke pahadon jaise badal uth khade hue. Phir Aap apne mimbar se na utre yahan tak ke main ne barish Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki dadhi par behte dekhi. Phir hum par us din barish hui, agle din, us se agle din, aur jo us se mile, doosre Juma tak. Phir wo dehati khada hua, ya kaha kisi aur ne, aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Imaratein gir gayein aur maal doob gaya. To Allah se hamare liye dua farmayiye. Phir Aap ne apne dono hath uthaye aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Hamare ird-gird aur hum par nahi. Phir Aap apne hath se badal ke kisi kinare ki taraf ishara na farmate magar wo phat jata. Aur Madina talaab jaisa ho gaya. Aur wadi Qanat ek mahina behti rahi. Aur kisi taraf se koi na aaya magar khoob barish ki khabar deta."
"518","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab aasman mein badal dekhte to aage badhte aur peechhe hatte, andar jate aur bahar nikalte, aur Aap ka chehra badal jata. Phir jab aasman barasata to Aap se door kar diya jata. Phir Aisha ne Aap ko is se khabar di. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main nahi janta, shayad jaise qaum ne kaha [phir jab unhon ne use apni wadiyon ki taraf aate badal dekha] ayat tak."
"519","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Saba [mashriqi hawa] se meri madad ki gayi, aur Aad Daboor [maghribi hawa] se halak kiye gaye."
